------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=16 DaVinci Talk Amazed2
Text=Others will come for these relics to try and piece the demon god together again, no matter what we may tell them. We must safeguard them from idle hands. Well done, Lionheart, you are truly a hero. Now come...we have much to tell the world and much to celebrate.
Should Have Voiceover=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=17 DaVinci Talk Evil1
Text=I have misjudged you, young one. The divine promise within you has turned sickly and putrid and has made you more evil than I could have ever forseen.
Should Have Voiceover=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=18 DaVinci Talk Evil2
Text=You may have become one with the Darkness, but it will turn against you in the end. Eventually you will be but a servant to what you now control. It is likely that I cannot defeat you, but we shall fight to the last against your evil scourge, scion of Lionheart, to the last...
Should Have Voiceover=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=20 Evil Ending All Live1
Text=So, evil destroys evil, but I suppose what we are left with is more treacherous and dangerous than before. Galileo, the relics, take them and go...
