------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=21 Evil Ending All Live2
Text=You may control the host, but you now lack all the relics to bring about a new Disjunction. While I cannot defeat you, we will gather our forces and fight you to the last, *Lionheart*. To the last...
Should Have Voiceover=1
------------------------------------------------------------
